{"id": "bio-007", "type": "biography", "title": "阿琳去世", "text": "1945年6月16日，阿琳在阿尔伯克基去世。她去世时他不在她身边，护士打电话通知他时说\"她走的时候，你终于可以不用再操心了\"。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "阿琳", "去世"], "source": "《理查德·费曼传》劳伦斯·M·克劳斯 p.94", "aliases": ["1945", "她去世", "阿琳什么时候死的", "阿琳去世", "阿琳怎么死的"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [{"kind": "stance", "word": "操心", "stance": "concern", "reason": "bad_target", "span": [58, 60], "quote": "操心", "clause": "你终于可以不用再操心了\""}], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 63, "person_mentions": 1, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 1, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 1}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "2d7caf0de37a644f"}
