{"id": "bio-027", "type": "biography", "title": "费曼物理学讲义", "text": "1961到1963年他为加州理工一二年级学生讲物理，课堂被录音整理成《费曼物理学讲义》。他说过自己对这本书并不满意，因为没教会学生解题。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "教学", "讲义"], "source": "《费曼经典：一个好奇者的探险人生》[美]理查德·P. 费曼 p.800", "year": 1961, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["教科书", "讲义", "费曼物理学讲义", "那本书"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 68, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 2, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "edc1ae76e5e74147"}
{"id": "bio-028", "type": "biography", "title": "巴西讲学", "text": "1951至1952年在巴西讲学一年。他批评那里的教育只教背诵公式、不教做实验。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "巴西", "教育"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "year": 1951, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["巴西", "里约"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 39, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "5a6a907cef587de9"}
{"id": "bio-029", "type": "biography", "title": "日本", "text": "1953年第一次去日本，1965年又去。他说在日本最难学的是不知道该对谁鞠躬、该对谁不鞠。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "日本"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "year": 1953, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["东京", "日本"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 45, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 2, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "933cd461247614de"}
{"id": "bio-030", "type": "biography", "title": "图瓦", "text": "他一直想去图瓦（唐努乌梁海），那是地图正中一个他去不了的地方。他最终没去成。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "图瓦"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "year": 1988, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["去不了的地方", "唐努", "图瓦"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 38, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "2da567fddcef2850"}
{"id": "bio-031", "type": "biography", "title": "诺贝尔奖", "text": "1965年获诺贝尔物理学奖。据他自述，他一度想过拒领，因为不想被头衔和仪式绑住。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "诺贝尔"], "source": "《费曼传：天才的人生与思想世界》詹姆斯·格雷克 p.352", "year": 1965, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["得奖", "诺奖", "诺贝尔"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [{"kind": "dated", "subject": "费曼", "event": "获奖", "year": "1965", "polarity": "assert", "unique_event": false, "ambiguous": false, "span": [0, 9], "quote": "1965年获诺贝尔", "clause": "1965年获诺贝尔物理学奖"}], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 40, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 1, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "f993d88dbc9a28e0"}
{"id": "bio-032", "type": "biography", "title": "拒领国家科学奖章", "text": "他拒绝了美国总统颁发的国家科学奖章。理由是他不喜欢被人颁奖这件事本身。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "荣誉"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "year": 1978, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["不要那个奖", "奖章", "拒领"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [{"kind": "stance", "word": "拒绝", "stance": "oppose", "reason": "bad_target", "span": [1, 3], "quote": "拒绝", "clause": "他拒绝了美国总统颁发的国家科学奖章"}], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 35, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 1, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 1}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "cb8ea1535b668dac"}
{"id": "bio-033", "type": "biography", "title": "挑战者号调查", "text": "1986年进入挑战者号事故调查委员会。他把O型密封圈的橡胶夹在冰水里压给委员会看，证明低温下橡胶失去弹性。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "挑战者号"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "year": 1986, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["O型圈", "你当时为什么那样做", "冰水", "密封圈", "挑战者", "航天飞机"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 53, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "b7dd5b98efcf342d"}
{"id": "bio-034", "type": "biography", "title": "不骗自己", "text": "1974年加州理工毕业典礼演讲《货物崇拜科学》里那句：第一原则是你不能欺骗自己，而你自己是最容易被骗的人。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "科学态度"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "year": 1974, "beyond_1946": true, "aliases": ["不骗自己", "自欺", "诚实", "货物崇拜"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [{"kind": "dated", "subject": "费曼", "event": "学位", "year": "1974", "polarity": "assert", "unique_event": false, "ambiguous": false, "span": [0, 11], "quote": "1974年加州理工毕业", "clause": "1974年加州理工毕业典礼演讲《货物崇拜科学》里那句：第一原则是你不能欺骗自己"}], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 53, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 1, "year_mentions": 1, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "bea9c23510234a2f"}
{"id": "bio-035", "type": "biography", "title": "不确定", "text": "他把\"不知道\"当成工作位置：科学是一种彻底的无知状态，而不是一堆结论的集合。", "tags": ["生平", "传记", "科学态度"], "source": "整理，未在语料中核对", "aliases": ["不知道", "不确定", "怀疑"], "source_class": "project_compilation", "verification_status": "unreviewed", "source_note": "未归类，按项目整理处理", "claims": [], "claims_skipped": [], "claim_coverage": {"schema": 6, "chars": 38, "person_mentions": 0, "relation_words": 0, "relation_attachable": 0, "relation_claims": 0, "relation_skipped": 0, "relation_ratio": null, "dated_claims": 0, "year_mentions": 0, "quantity_claims": 0, "quantity_mentions": 0, "stance_mentions": 0, "stance_claims": 0, "stance_skipped": 0}, "claims_schema": 6, "claims_text_hash": "ff7b4cc0198e19fe"}
